    "body": "I feel like the following might be a more important detail than ISO-8601 supporting truncation.\r\n\r\n> The parsing already supports it.\r\n\r\nOf course it also becomes trivially easy for a coder in these situations to limit the decimal places represented to three themselves and overcome the errant behaviour.\r\n\r\nI'm unsure where I sit, but https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ISO_8601 seems to suggest only 2 seconds in all examples I quickly scanned over with no decimal precision at all",
